      "Lidong",
      "",
      "Lidong is one of the 24 solar terms of the lunar calendar, and one of China's traditional holidays.",
      "Lidong usually occurs each year between November 7th and 8th.",
      "“Li” can mean “beginning”, and so Lidong means the beginning of winter.",
      "",
      "So what do people like to eat during Lidong?",
      "In the south, people like to eat chicken, duck, fish and meat during Lidong.",
      "In the north, people like to eat steaming hot dumplings.",
      "It is said that the tradition of eating dumplings comes from the saying “time of transition”.",
      "Lidong is the transition from autumn to winter, and at the time of “jiao zi” you should eat “jiao zi”.",
      "That people like to eat dumplings during the Lunar New Year comes from the same logic:",
      "Because the Lunar New Year is the transition from the old year to the new year.",
